            "• Runs `apt-get update` and inspects pending Debian upgrades\n"
            "• Maps `ldd` shared library links & source timestamps to rebuild ONLY affected CDE apps\n"
            "• Downloads & installs updates with live progress, recompiles binaries, restarts `dtwm`,\n"
